Date: Mon, 30 Jun 2025 22:26:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 67/82] drm/etnaviv: move some functions to a header to be able
 to use them externally

Upstream-Status: Pending [https://lore.kernel.org/all/20250630202703.13844-3-gert.wollny@collabora.com/]
Signed-off-by: Gert Wollny <gert.wollny@collabora.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/etnaviv/etnaviv_buffer.c | 71 +-------------------
 drivers/gpu/drm/etnaviv/etnaviv_buffer.h | 85 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
